sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SST as SST Cron
  participant CronReq as /api/jobs/evaluate-usage (Route)
  participant Route as Route Handler
  participant UseCase as EvaluateUsageAndNotifyUseCase
  participant Billing as BillingUsageProvider (Stripe+DB)
  participant DB as Prisma/Postgres
  participant NotificationRepo as NotificationRepoPrisma
  participant StateRepo as UserBillingStateRepoPrisma
  participant Frontend as Browser (User)
  participant API as /api/notifications (Route)
  participant UI as NotificationsMenu / SubscriptionBanner
  participant Checkout as create-stripe-checkout (Server Action)
  participant Stripe as Stripe (Checkout & Webhooks)
  participant Webhook as /api/webhooks/stripe/route.ts

  Note over SST,CronReq: Agendador (hourly) dispara job
  SST->>CronReq: POST /api/jobs/evaluate-usage (X-Infra-Key)
  CronReq->>Route: validar secret & body
  Route->>UseCase: instanciar deps (Billing, NotificationRepo, StateRepo) e chamar execute()
  UseCase->>Billing: getUsageForActiveSubscriptions(batch)
  Billing->>UseCase: [{userId, subscriptionId, currentUsage, planLimit, periodStart, daysLeft, suggestedPlanId}, ...]
  loop para cada record (paginated)
    UseCase->>StateRepo: getByUser(userId)
    StateRepo-->>UseCase: state
    UseCase->>UseCase: calcular percentUsed & cycleId
    alt novo cycle
      UseCase->>StateRepo: upsertState(userId, cycleId, notified80=false)
    end
    alt percentUsed >= 80 && !state.notified80 && !recentNotification(24h)
      UseCase->>NotificationRepo: create(Notification{...})
      NotificationRepo-->>DB: INSERT
      UseCase->>StateRepo: setNotified80(userId, true)  --(atomic ideally)-->
      UseCase->>Route: emit metrics (notifications_created)
    else
      UseCase->>Route: contabilizar skipped
    end
  end
  Route->>SST: return summary {created, skipped, processed}
  Note over Frontend,API: Periodicamente/ao carregar
  Frontend->>API: GET /api/notifications (session cookie)
  API->>NotificationRepo: listByUser(userId)
  NotificationRepo-->>API: [notifications ordered unread first]
  API-->>Frontend: JSON notifications
  Frontend->>UI: render badge, dropdown, banner
  alt usuário clica "Ver planos"
    UI->>API: PATCH /api/notifications/:id/read
    API->>NotificationRepo: markRead(id)
    UI->>Checkout: chamar create-stripe-checkout(suggestedPlanId) / redirect
    Checkout->>Stripe: inicia sessão de checkout
    Stripe->>Frontend: redirect checkout (user completes purchase)
    Stripe->>Webhook: envia evento de subscription update
    Webhook->>StateRepo: reset notified80 / mark notifications read for cycle
    Webhook->>Route: emit metrics (checkout_success_from_notification)
  end
